##Run these commands in the VS Code terminal from the project folder:

cd "C:\Users\anany hanu vaishnav\Downloads\AI Athlete Insights (3)"
npm install
npm run dev

Vite will print a local URL, usually:

http://localhost:3000


Open that URL in your browser.

To run the optional FastAPI backend in a second VS Code terminal:

cd "C:\Users\anany hanu vaishnav\Downloads\AI Athlete Insights (3)\backend"
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
pip install -r requirements.txt
Copy-Item .env.example .env
alembic upgrade head
python -m app.bootstrap
uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --proxy-headers


The backend will be available at:
http://localhost:8080

To connect the frontend to that backend, create .env.local in the project root with:
VITE_ASSESSMENT_API_URL=http://localhost:8080


Then restart npm run dev.

Useful checks:
npm test
npm run build

